(text "Not connected on purpose: 1 ACC_SENSE, 2 HOLD (pulling it low cuts the PC power), 9/10 vehicle bus, 12 main 3V3, 13 5V_EXT.\nThe hub makes its own 5 V / 3.3 V from pin 14 (VSW, 12 V, fused 1.1 A on the main board).\n100R series resistors protect the XIAO pins against wiring mistakes." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 129.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7dc9799e-534b-4397-a184-ad934e937850"))
