(text "PULSE-A/B and AUX have the same pin order as PWR-CTRL J8/J9 (1 12V, 2 5V, 3 GND, 4 IO): PULSE-IN plugs in with a straight cable.\nD2/D3 are also on main J8/J9: use only one connector per pin. D10 is shared by AUX and GPS PPS (JP3): use one of them.\nJP2 selects GPS power (default 3V3)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214.63 265.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "62be16da-76f3-46a6-817d-c49733978326"))
